    "detailed_description": "Originally released in 1988 for the Commodore Amiga, this arcade-style top-down shooter saw players take on the role of members of a 4-man squad fighting through a treacherous jungle environment. Now, relive those days in this remastered emulated version.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>With up to 4 players in co-op play, advance as far as you can through enemy territory. Switch between a heavy machinegun (which has longer range), a light machinegun (which fires faster) and grenades (which do damage in an area and can be thrown over obstacles).<br><br><br>This enhanced version introduces a number of modern features to this retro classic, including:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Saving/loading the game at any point<br></li><li> Support for most modern game controllers<br></li><li> Full control remapping<br></li><li> Image scaling and smoothing options</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Originally released in 1988 for the Commodore Amiga, this arcade-style top-down shooter saw players take on the role of members of a 4-man squad fighting through a treacherous jungle environment. Now, relive those days in this remastered emulated version.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>With up to 4 players in co-op play, advance as far as you can through enemy territory. Switch between a heavy machinegun (which has longer range), a light machinegun (which fires faster) and grenades (which do damage in an area and can be thrown over obstacles).<br><br><br>This enhanced version introduces a number of modern features to this retro classic, including:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Saving/loading the game at any point<br></li><li> Support for most modern game controllers<br></li><li> Full control remapping<br></li><li> Image scaling and smoothing options</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "In this arcade-style top-down shooter, originally released in 1988 for the Commodore Amiga, take on the role of members of a 4-man squad fighting through a treacherous jungle environment. Play with up to 4 player local co-op.",
